{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日（4日）下午3時許，警方接報長沙灣道116號地下一間雜貨店內發生傷人案，一名男子懷疑被人用刀襲擊，頭部流血受傷。</p><p>警方到場，當場以涉嫌傷人拘捕涉案男疑犯。</p><p>被捕人與傷者均清醒，分別由救護車送往明愛醫院。</p><p>警方正調查事件原因。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T09:45:40.207958+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T09:15:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T09:38:24.190137+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T09:38:24.190137+00:00","content_hash":"c829450e46cb625bdb90072c34598c20720c16c95267be5e067d6a87eb0d497b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}